# Context filter for the BACKEND image (repo-root context, root Dockerfile).
# The frontend image uses frontend/Dockerfile.dockerignore instead (BuildKit prefers the
# Dockerfile-adjacent ignore file), so entries here only shape the backend build context.
.git
**/bin
**/obj
**/.idea
**/.vs
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/.next
frontend/design-reference
frontend/coverage
# Phase 12 desktop shell: Rust sources + a multi-GB cargo target/ dir (was 5 GB of build context per image build).
frontend/src-tauri
# Local tooling output (headless Chrome, Lighthouse, trivy/Sonar caches) and the result archive — never inputs.
.bench
**/.sonarqube
thesis
load/results
docs
**/*.md
**/*.tsbuildinfo
